{
  "id": "poem-3bcb9e2f7fa55d1c9b7bca5a",
  "title": "前腔",
  "author": "高明《蔡伯喈琵琶记》",
  "dynasty": "元",
  "verses": [
    "觑着爹颜衰鬓星，痛点点教别泪暗零。",
    "爹爹，我左难右难：误了公婆，被人讥评；撇了亲爹，又没人看承。",
    "(合前)(生唱)。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "元曲选",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/元曲/yuanqu.json#record-5253",
